---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const canonical = "https://www.hopewellhealthsolutions.com/privacy/";
const updated = "November 22, 2026";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | Hopewell Health Solutions" description="How Hopewell Health Solutions collects, uses, and protects information submitted through this website — and how it differs from the protected health information covered by our HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices." canonical={canonical}>
  <Header />

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="bg-crema">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pt-8 pb-14">
      <nav class="text-xs text-muted mb-6"><a href="/" class="hover:text-azul">Home</a> / <span class="text-ink">Privacy Policy</span></nav>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-azul">Your privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink leading-[1.08]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="mt-5 h-px w-16 bg-gold"></div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-muted text-sm">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BODY -->
  <!-- Rewritten 2026-11-22 to describe the tools actually on the site (HHS | Website Data & Tracking Record, Nov 2026;
       DMC Law guidance: tailor it, say what is really there, don't over-promise, keep it current, keep prior versions).
       Update this page whenever a tool is added or removed, and keep the previous version in git history. -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 space-y-10 text-ink leading-relaxed text-[17px]">

      <p>Hopewell Health Solutions (“we,” “us,” or “our”) operates this website, hopewellhealthsolutions.com. This Privacy Policy explains what information the website collects, which tools collect it, who receives it, and the choices you have. We have written it to describe the tools that are actually on this website today.</p>

      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-azul-light/40 border border-azul/30 p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-ink">In short</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 pl-1 text-[16px]">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>We do not use the Meta (Facebook) pixel or any other advertising or remarketing pixel on this website.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>We do not sell your information, and this website does not send it to advertising platforms.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>Google Analytics runs only if you accept analytics cookies, and it is not used for advertising.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>Calls and website forms go to our secure call and lead management platform, under a Business Associate Agreement that requires it to safeguard them as HIPAA requires.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">This policy and your health records</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy covers information collected through this website. Health information we receive as a healthcare provider, including what you share with our admissions team and during your care, is also protected under our <a href="/hipaa-notice/" class="text-azul font-semibold">HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices</a> and protected under federal law, including 42 CFR Part 2 for substance use disorder records.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Information you give us</h2>
        <p>When you fill in a form on this website, such as the insurance verification form, you may give us:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-1">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>Your name, phone number and email address.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>Your insurance company, member or policy ID and date of birth, and photos of your insurance card if you choose to upload them.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>Whether you agree to receive text messages from us.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>The form also sends how you reached the website: the page you first landed on, the referring website, and campaign labels in the link you followed (such as utm_source). We use these to know which of our listings and outreach efforts help people find us.</p>
        <p>When you call one of the phone numbers on this website, the call is handled by our call and lead management platform (see below), which records the call details and may record the call.</p>
        <p>We use this information to respond to you, check your insurance benefits, talk with you about admission and, if you opt in, send you text messages. Form submissions go directly to our call and lead management platform over an encrypted connection. They are not stored on the website, and their contents are not written to the website’s logs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Information collected automatically</h2>
        <p>Like most websites, the servers that host this site receive basic technical information when you visit: your IP address, browser and device type, the page requested, and the time of the request. Our hosting provider uses this to deliver the site and keep it secure.</p>
        <p>Other information is collected only by the tools described in the next section, and only as described there.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Tools on this website</h2>
        <p>These are the third-party tools on this website, what each one receives and who receives it.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-1">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Call and lead management platform.</strong> Shows a tracking phone number so we can tell which page or listing led to a call, and receives the calls and form submissions described above, along with the pages you visited and your browser and device information. The provider works for Hopewell under a signed Business Associate Agreement, which requires it to protect this information as HIPAA requires. It runs on every page, including before you make a cookie choice, because it is how your calls and forms reach us.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Google Tag Manager.</strong> Loads the other tools on the site. Loading it sends Google basic technical information, such as your IP address and browser type, but it does not collect what you do on the site on its own.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Google Analytics.</strong> Runs only if you accept analytics cookies. It receives the pages you view, the page address, and site events such as clicking a phone number or email link, scrolling, or submitting a form. It does not receive anything you type into a form, such as your name, phone number, email or insurance information. Google signals and ad personalization are turned off, our Google Analytics account is not linked to any advertising account, and visit-level data is kept for 2 months. The recipient is Google.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Embedded content.</strong> Google Maps, YouTube videos (in YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode) and accreditation seals load only if you accept functional cookies or choose to load them. Once loaded, Google or the seal provider receives your visit to that page and may set its own cookies.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use the Meta (Facebook) pixel, other advertising or remarketing pixels, or session recording tools on this website, and we do not send information from this website to Google for advertising.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Cookies and information stored in your browser</h2>
        <p>A cookie is a small file a website saves in your browser. This website uses:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-1">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Necessary:</strong> a cookie that remembers your cookie choices for 12 months, and settings saved in your browser for the accessibility panel and for announcements you have closed. These stay on your device.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Functional:</strong> cookies set by embedded maps and videos, only after you allow them.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics cookies, only after you allow them. If you later turn analytics off, these cookies are deleted.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Call tracking:</strong> cookies from our call and lead management platform that connect your visit to your call or form, as described above.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Campaign details:</strong> the landing page, referring website and campaign labels described above are saved in your browser so they can be sent with a form.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span><strong>Advertising:</strong> only if you allow advertising cookies. If you reached the site from an online ad, the ad click identifier in the link is saved in your browser and sent to our call and lead management platform with your call or form, so we know which ad led to it. This website does not send it to the ad platform.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Your choices</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-1">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>When you first visit, a cookie banner asks for your choice. Optional cookies stay off until you choose, and you can reject them all with one click.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>You can change your choice at any time with “Cookie Preferences” at the bottom of every page.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>If your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal, we treat it as a request to opt out of advertising cookies.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>“Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information” at the bottom of every page turns advertising cookies off. We do not sell personal information.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Some parts of the site, such as maps and videos, may not load if you do.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>To stop text messages, reply STOP to any message.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">How we share information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent or trade your information. We share it only:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-1">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>With the service providers named above, so they can run these tools for us.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>With your insurance company or a benefits verification service when you ask us to check your benefits.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-azul"></span><span>When the law requires it, or to protect the safety of you or others.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">How we protect information</h2>
        <p>The website uses encrypted connections (HTTPS) on every page, and forms are sent over an encrypted connection to our call and lead management platform. We limit the tools on the site to the ones described here and review them when we make changes. No website or transmission is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Teens and children</h2>
        <p>Hopewell offers programs for tweens, teens and adults. If the person seeking care is under 18, a parent or guardian should complete the website forms. This website is not meant for children to use on their own, and we do not knowingly collect personal information directly from a child under 13 through it. If you believe a child has given us information through this website, please contact us so we can delete it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>This website links to other websites, such as news articles, research and our social media pages. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We update this policy when we add or remove a tool on the website, and we review it at least once a year. The date at the top shows the latest update, and we keep copies of previous versions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-line pt-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink">Contact us</h2>
        <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy? Contact us by phone at <a href="tel:8607351448" class="text-azul font-semibold">(860) 735-1448</a> or by mail at 1216 Farmington Ave., Suite 301, West Hartford, CT 06107.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Base>
